1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Welcome to Tech Fest 2026 at IGDTUW Delhi.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,500
The audience is settling in.

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,000
Everyone is waiting for the show to begin.

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
The robot race begins with three autonomous bots built by second year students.

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:09,000
The red line-following robot takes the lead using a PID controller and infrared sensors.

6
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,500
The crowd is cheering.

7
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,000
Everyone is enjoying the event.

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Next, sixteen drones perform a synchronised light show programmed with swarm algorithms.

9
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,000
The drones form a rotating ring controlled over a single wireless ground station.

10
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Here is the replay of the race finish from the trackside camera.

11
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:19,000
The red line-following robot overtakes on the final curve and crosses the finish line two seconds ahead, a new fest record.

12
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,500
Team Circuit Queens wins the first prize of fifty thousand rupees for the robot race.

13
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:22,000
The drone team receives a special award for innovation from the Vice Chancellor.

14
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Thank you for watching.

